+
+config SYSTEM_DSI_DIAG
+	tristate "MIPI-DSI runtime diagnostics"
+	default n
+	depends on ESPRESSIF_MIPI_DSI_DIAG
+	---help---
+		Build dsi_diag, which reads and resets the atomic ESP32-P4
+		MIPI-DSI runtime counters exposed through /dev/dsi-diag0.
